{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"livestock_farm","model_identifier":"livestock_farm","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# livestock_farm\n\nLivestock farm: a fenced pen with a chicken coop on stilts (ramp up to the hatch) and a feeding trough, plus a small feed shed.\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 10 columns (160 x 160 units, 4.50 x 4.50 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -78..78, y 0..58, z -78..78 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 71, construction_0 21, construction_33 26, construction_66 38, ruined 21 (11 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- coop: 48 x 60 x 36 centred at x 36, z 36\n- pen fence: 152 x 18 x 152 ring\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `livestock_farm_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `livestock_farm_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_livestock_farm` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_pen` at (-10, 0, -10)\n- `slot_door` at (36, 0, -14)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"fence_post0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-77.5,0.0,-77.5],"to":[-74.5,18.0,-74.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8.5,176.0,11.5,194.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[8.5,176.0,11.5,194.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[8.5,176.0,11.5,194.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[8.5,176.0,11.5,194.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[174.5,203.5,177.5,206.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[174.5,203.5,177.5,206.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"19216a12-7c82-54bd-833e-17dbedd04192"},{"name":"fence_post1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-52.1667,0.0,-77.5],"to":[-49.1667,18.0,-74.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[12.8333,176.0,15.8333,194.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[8.5,176.0,11.5,194.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[12.8333,176.0,15.8333,194.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[8.5,176.0,11.5,194.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[178.8333,203.5,181.8333,206.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[178.8333,203.5,181.8333,206.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"1b5b5cb8-c7c7-50a5-a3dc-d495d58ec7b9"},{"name":"fence_post2","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-26.8333,0.0,-77.5],"to":[-23.8333,18.0,-74.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16.1667,176.0,19.1667,194.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[8.5,176.0,11.5,194.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[16.1667,176.0,19.1667,194.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[8.5,176.0,11.5,194.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[182.1667,203.5,185.1667,206.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[182.1667,203.5,185.1667,206.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"776bc295-35aa-554c-b81