0..58, z -78..78 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 71, construction_0 21, construction_33 26, construction_66 38, ruined 21 (11 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- coop: 48 x 60 x 36 centred at x 36, z 36\n- pen fence: 152 x 18 x 152 ring\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `livestock_farm_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `livestock_farm_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_livestock_farm` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_pen` at (-10, 0, -10)\n- `slot_door` at (36, 0, -14)\n"}